WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.020
Okay, let's go.

00:04.280 --> 00:05.240
Next question.

00:05.360 --> 00:06.060
Ooh, a new platform.

00:06.200 --> 00:07.140
I see this is Super.

00:07.760 --> 00:11.200
It is time for Super trivia.

00:12.340 --> 00:14.700
Which boy band is the best?

00:15.020 --> 00:17.860
Tina, I can watch you having a meltdown
over this.

00:18.260 --> 00:19.280
Do I ask a question?

00:19.480 --> 00:20.220
Like, how does it work?

00:20.900 --> 00:21.960
Whatever you want, right?

00:22.160 --> 00:22.460
Okay.

00:22.920 --> 00:24.940
What is your ideal realistic first date?

00:25.440 --> 00:25.880
Drinks.

00:26.060 --> 00:27.240
I think it's really low pressure.

00:27.440 --> 00:28.060
It's casual.

00:28.060 --> 00:30.800
It doesn't have a set amount of time.

00:31.280 --> 00:33.600
Name three cereals.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.940
Cinnamon Toast Crunch, Lucky Charms, and
Chet McSereal.

00:38.380 --> 00:39.540
He knew that question was coming.

00:40.580 --> 00:41.980
I guess so, he was ready.

00:42.280 --> 00:43.600
So I want to go into the poll stage.

00:44.100 --> 00:46.020
Which news viewing experience they prefer?

00:46.180 --> 00:47.360
This is a big fundamental question.

00:47.460 --> 00:50.960
I think that we probably, our audience
here, Brian, is going to be a little bit biased.

00:50.960 --> 00:54.660
The whole idea is that we're raising money
for Feeding America.

00:54.840 --> 00:57.200
Super Chat, that's where you're going to
go in and donate when you want to donate.

00:57.200 --> 00:58.100
Get his number here.

00:58.220 --> 00:59.780
Oh, my God.

01:00.140 --> 01:00.700
He called me.

01:00.880 --> 01:01.900
He called me.

01:04.180 --> 01:05.840
Token support for being good people.

01:06.160 --> 01:07.100
I think he meant you.

01:07.540 --> 01:08.540
This is what I'm talking about.

01:08.580 --> 01:10.180
But first of all, J.D., thank you very
much.

01:10.320 --> 01:12.300
I think we can take a selfie on here.

01:12.420 --> 01:12.520
Wait.

01:12.940 --> 01:13.880
Yeah, yeah, check this out.

01:14.500 --> 01:15.840
Get your handsomest face on.

01:15.940 --> 01:16.380
Here we go.

01:20.620 --> 01:21.300
You know what?

01:21.480 --> 01:23.120
Super is kind of coming through here.
